# Rich and poor, the Heights and the Sump, the Houses (theme n7): deference, resentment, charity, snobbery. The opener
# remembers the kind of remark (conv.st), the other answers as they stand and remembers how they took it
# (conv.sa: humble, bite, joke, give, refuse, grateful, proud, manage, advised, concede, nod, warmnod, sneer, chat,
# kind), and the opener has the last word, chosen by that and by who they are. The remarks between rich and poor
# hold only between strangers and acquaintances: nobody calls their own brother "sir".

## The opener

rule n7_st_snob
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.wealth=rich other.wealth=poor|destitute self.warmth=cold pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {st=snub on=station} Do mind the coat. It's new. | {st=snub on=station} Might you stand a little downwind? It's the... well. Never mind. | {st=snub on=station} One sees all sorts in the street these days.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_rich_kind
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.wealth=rich other.wealth=poor|destitute self.warmth=warm pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {st=charity on=station} Have you eaten today? Truly? | {st=charity on=station} You look cold. Here, I've a scarf I never wear. | {st=charity on=station} Is there anything we could send round? Don't be proud.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_rich_frank
when concept=talk.smalltalk self.wealth=rich other.wealth=poor|destitute self.honesty=frank pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {st=pity on=station} I don't know how you manage. I'd not last a week. | {st=pity on=station} Is it true you eat the same thing every day? I'd go mad. | {st=pity on=station} My cook spends more on butter than you earn. That's wrong, isn't it.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_rich_advice
when concept=talk.smalltalk self.wealth=rich other.wealth=poor self.drive=ambitious|steady pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {st=advice on=station} You ought to put a penny by each week. That's how my father started. | {st=advice on=station} Have you thought of a trade? A trade's the thing. | {st=advice on=station} Buy cheap in the morning, sell dear at night. There, that's my secret.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_poor_resent
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.wealth=poor|destitute other.wealth=rich self.temper=short pair.band=strangers|acquaintances|rivals
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {st=resent on=station} Nice boots. Cost more than my roof? | {st=resent on=station} Out slumming, are we? | {st=resent on=station} Must be a hard life, all that sitting.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_poor_defer
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.wealth=poor|destitute other.wealth=rich self.temper=calm|even|nervy pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does greet
cooldown 2d
say {st=defer on=station} #good_day# to you, #sir#. | {st=defer on=station} Lovely coat, #sir#, if I may say. | {st=defer on=station} Begging your pardon, #sir#. Am I in your way?
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_poor_work
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.work self.wealth=poor|destitute other.wealth=rich self.drive=ambitious|restless pair.band=strangers|acquaintances self.stage=adult|adolescent
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {st=work on=station} If you've need of a strong back up at your place, I'm your wolf. | {st=work on=station} Your house want any work done? I'm cheap and I'm quick. | {st=work on=station} I can carry, scrub, mend, anything. Just ask.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_beg
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.homeless=yes other.wealth=rich|comfortable pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does request
priority 1
cooldown 1d
say {st=beg on=station} Spare a penny, #sir#? For bread, I swear it. | {st=beg on=station} Anything for a cold wolf? Anything at all? | {st=beg on=station} I'll not drink it. I'll eat it. Honest.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_beg_sly
when concept=talk.smalltalk self.honesty=sly self.wealth=poor|destitute other.wealth=rich pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {st=beg on=station} You've a kind face. Has anyone told you? A generous face. | {st=beg on=station} A wolf like you wouldn't miss a penny. Would you? | {st=beg on=station} I knew your father. Lovely wolf. Lent me money once.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_sump_heights
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=sump other.quarter=heights here.region=ridgemere pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does ask.detail
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {st=resent on=station} Come down the hill to see how the rest live? | {st=resent on=station} Lost, are you? The Heights are that way. Up. | {st=resent on=station} Mind your boots. The street bites, down here.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_heights_sump
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=heights other.quarter=sump self.wealth=rich|comfortable here.region=ridgemere pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does ask.detail
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {st=pity on=station} Is it true the water comes up through the floors down there? | {st=pity on=station} I've never been below the Commons, you know. Is it very bad? | {st=pity on=station} My aunt does good works in the Sump. Do you know her? She wears a hat.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_commons
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=commons here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=middle on=station} Too poor for the Heights, too proud for the Sump. That's the Commons. | {st=middle on=station} The Commons: where everyone's one bad winter from the Sump and one good one from nothing. | {st=middle on=station} Middle of the hill, middle of the purse.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_heights
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=heights self.wealth=rich|comfortable here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=heights on=station} The Heights Market's dearer every week. They call it fashion. | {st=heights on=station} Three dinners this week and the same soup at every one. | {st=heights on=station} They're painting the whole terrace blue now. Greatly's blue, of course.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_sump
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=sump here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=sump on=station} The Soup Kitchen ran out by noon. Again. | {st=sump on=station} Somebody's taken the boards off the empty house for firewood. Good luck to them. | {st=sump on=station} They say the Sump's sinking a claw's breadth a year. I believe it.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_wharf
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=wharf|docks|harbour_hill here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=wharf on=station} The Customs House takes its cut before the ropes are tied. | {st=wharf on=station} Ships full of things none of us will ever own. | {st=wharf on=station} Every crate goes up the hill, and every penny with it.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_works
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=works here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=works on=station} We make the bricks for the Heights and live in the dust of them. | {st=works on=station} Greatly's kilns, Timberland's furnaces, and us in between, coughing. | {st=works on=station} Every House in the city has its paw in the works, and not one of them lives here.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_office
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=office here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=office on=station} Up the hill they call us ink-paws. Down the hill they call us worse. | {st=office on=station} The City Office quarter: we write it all down and own none of it. | {st=office on=station} Clerks, stewards and the Watch House. Quiet street. Nobody laughs.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_estate
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.quarter=estate|suburbs self.job!=servant here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=outside on=station} Lovely and quiet out our way. Too quiet. | {st=outside on=station} It's a long walk in, but you don't smell the Sump. | {st=outside on=station} Out past the gate you can hear yourself think. Not that I think much.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_greatly
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.work self.house=greatly_house !other.house here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=house on=station} Greatly built the walls of this city. Folk forget that. | {st=house on=station} Every brick, every tile, every lick of whitewash. Ours. | {st=house on=station} The Yard's never been busier. Say what you like about the House, it builds.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_grayrock
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.work self.house=grayrock_hall !other.house
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=house on=station} Without Grayrock's wharf this city'd starve by spring. | {st=house on=station} Six ships in last night. That's the House's heart beating. | {st=house on=station} Grayrock: the wharf and all on it. Not pretty. Lasts.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_fell
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.work self.house=house_fell !other.house
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=house on=station} Every glass raised in Ridgemere was filled from a Fell cask. | {st=house on=station} The House is buying up the whole apple harvest. Mark me. | {st=house on=station} Wine's honest. Fell's honest. More or less.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_mossgrave
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore|talk.work self.house=mossgrave_court|timberland_court !other.house
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=house on=station} Every nail in your boots came off a Timberland anvil, I'd bet. | {st=house on=station} The Ironworks ran all night for the festival. The whole Cinders glowed. | {st=house on=station} Timberland keeps the city in iron. Somebody has to.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_house
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.work self.house self.wealth!=rich
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {st=houselife on=station} The House expects. The House always expects. | {st=houselife on=station} When you're the House's, folk talk to the House, not to you. | {st=houselife on=station} Our steward counted the candles. Every candle.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_to_house
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore other.house !self.house pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {st=house_ask on=station} You're the House's, aren't you? Tell your masters the rest of us would like a word. | {st=house_ask on=station} When's your House going to pay a fair wage, then? | {st=house_ask on=station} Is it true what they say? That the Houses dine off gold plates?
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_poor_friends
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends self.wealth=poor|destitute other.wealth=poor|destitute pair.band=friends|family
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {st=poorfriends on=station} We'll be rich one day, you and I. Or grey. One of the two. | {st=poorfriends on=station} When I'm rich I'll buy you a hat. A stupid one. | {st=poorfriends on=station} Remember when we thought a silver penny was a fortune? It still is.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_friend_richer
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends pair.band=friends self.wealth=poor|comfortable other.wealth=rich
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {st=envy on=station} You've done well for yourself. Don't forget the rest of us. | {st=envy on=station} I knew you when you'd one shirt. | {st=envy on=station} Is it true you've a cook now? A cook!
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_rival_rich
when concept=talk.smalltalk pair.band=rivals self.wealth=rich other.wealth!=rich
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {st=rivalsnub on=station} How's the little business? Still going? | {st=rivalsnub on=station} I see you've mended your coat. Again. | {st=rivalsnub on=station} We're having the front done. You must come and look. From the street.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_servant
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.work self.job=servant
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {st=servant on=station} The mistress had me polish the silver twice. It was clean the first time. | {st=servant on=station} They've guests tonight. Forty. I'll be up till dawn. | {st=servant on=station} In service, you learn to be a chair. Nobody sees a chair.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_noble
when concept=talk.smalltalk self.job=noble
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {st=heights on=station} One is so terribly busy doing nothing at all. | {st=heights on=station} Someone asked my opinion on the levy today. Imagine. I hadn't one. | {st=heights on=station} Another dinner tonight. I shall have to be charming for four hours.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_old_service
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.stage=old self.wealth=poor|destitute self.job=servant|none|beggar here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=servant on=station} Forty years in service up the hill. Never once learned my name. | {st=servant on=station} I scrubbed the Greatly steps when the old lord was a pup. He kicked me once. | {st=servant on=station} They gave me a pot of jam when I left. Forty years. Jam.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_country_city
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.from=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|mirebridge|fenshore|larkfield|southmeadow|saltwell here.region=ridgemere
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=country on=station} In Ridgemere a beggar sleeps by a lord's gate. At home, the beggar would be fed and the lord would know his name. | {st=country on=station} Back home rich and poor drink at the same well. Here they've a well each. | {st=country on=station} Nobody looks at anybody here. At home I'd know every face on this street.
then other: town.station

rule n7_st_town_city
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.lore self.from=ridgemere here.region=frosthollow|coldwater|oakhaven|fens|larkfield|southmeadow
does tell.story
cooldown 3d
say {st=city on=station} In the city you can buy anything at any hour. Here they shut when the baker's tired. | {st=city on=station} I miss the lamps. The whole city lit up on the hill. | {st=city on=station} Folk here know everything about you. In Ridgemere nobody cared.
then other: town.station

## Answering, as they stand (self answers; conv.st says what the remark was)

rule n7_sa_plain
when concept=town.station
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} Hm. That's the way of it. | {sa=chat} Is that so. | {sa=chat} Well. There it is. | {sa=chat} If you say so.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_snub_poor
when concept=town.station conv.st=snub
does react.complaint
say {sa=humble} Sorry, #sir#. | {sa=humble} Right you are. I'll stand over here, then. | {sa=humble} Course. Wouldn't want to dirty anything.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_snub_short
when concept=town.station conv.st=snub|rivalsnub self.temper=short
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} Mind your nose. It's that far in the air it'll catch the rain. | {sa=bite} Charming. And a good day to you, I'm sure. | {sa=bite} I'd sooner stand by a midden than by you.
regard self: affinity -1
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_snub_rival
when concept=town.station conv.st=rivalsnub
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} Still here. Still standing. Disappointed? | {sa=bite} Say what you like. I sleep fine. | {sa=bite} Enjoy it. Money's a fair-weather friend.
regard self: affinity -1
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_snub_dry
when concept=town.station conv.st=snub|rivalsnub self.humour=dry
does react.complaint
say {sa=joke} I'll try to be poor further away. | {sa=joke} Of course. My fleas are very particular about company. | {sa=joke} Kind of you to notice me.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_charity
when concept=town.station conv.st=charity
does react.complaint
say {sa=grateful} Bless you. Truly. | {sa=grateful} I... thank you. That's kind. | {sa=grateful} You're a good soul. There's not many like you. | {sa=grateful} I'll not say no. Thank you.
regard self: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_charity_proud
when concept=town.station conv.st=charity|pity self.warmth=cold
does react.complaint
say {sa=proud} We manage, thank you. | {sa=proud} I'll not be anyone's good deed. | {sa=proud} Keep it. We're not so badly off as that.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_pity
when concept=town.station conv.st=pity
does react.complaint
say {sa=manage} We manage. Somehow we manage. | {sa=manage} You'd be surprised what you can do without. | {sa=manage} It's not so bad. It's bad. But not so bad.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_pity_dry
when concept=town.station conv.st=pity self.humour=dry
does react.complaint
say {sa=joke} Oh, it's a palace. We just keep the walls damp for the look of it. | {sa=joke} You'd last a day. We'd lay bets on the hour. | {sa=joke} We get by on porridge and spite.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_pity_sump
when concept=town.station conv.st=pity self.quarter=sump
does react.complaint
say {sa=manage} Come down and see. Nobody'll bite. Much. | {sa=manage} It's home. It's damp, but it's home. | {sa=manage} Ask anyone in the Soup Kitchen line. They'll tell you.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_advice
when concept=town.station conv.st=advice
does react.complaint
say {sa=advised} Easy said. | {sa=advised} I'll start tomorrow. With what, I don't know. | {sa=advised} Thank you. I'll write it down, if I can find something to write on.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_advice_ambitious
when concept=town.station conv.st=advice self.drive=ambitious
does react.complaint
say {sa=advised} I've been saving. Two years. I'll have a stall by spring. | {sa=advised} Teach me, then. I mean it. | {sa=advised} I'll take that. And one day I'll pay it back with interest.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_resent
when concept=town.station conv.st=resent
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} Steady on. | {sa=bite} Who rattled your cage? | {sa=bite} No need for that.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_resent_rich
when concept=town.station conv.st=resent self.wealth=rich|comfortable
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} I'll thank you to mind your tongue. | {sa=bite} I work for what I have, the same as you. | {sa=bite} There's no call for that.
regard self: affinity -1
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_resent_warm
when concept=town.station conv.st=resent self.wealth=rich|comfortable self.warmth=warm
does react.complaint
say {sa=concede} Fair. I'd say it too, in your boots. | {sa=concede} I suppose I deserve that. | {sa=concede} You're not wrong. Walk with me a bit? Tell me what you'd change.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_resent_dry
when concept=town.station conv.st=resent self.humour=dry self.wealth=rich|comfortable
does react.complaint
say {sa=joke} Do go on. I've an hour before dinner. | {sa=joke} Envy suits you. It brings out your eyes. | {sa=joke} I'll have that engraved on something.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_defer
when concept=town.station conv.st=defer
does react.complaint
say {sa=nod} #good_day#. | {sa=nod} Not at all. Carry on. | {sa=nod} Hm? Oh. Yes. #good_day#.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_defer_warm
when concept=town.station conv.st=defer self.warmth=warm
does react.complaint
say {sa=warmnod} No need for sirs with me. My grandmother sold fish. | {sa=warmnod} #good_day# to you too. How's your family? | {sa=warmnod} Please. Call me by my name.
regard other: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_work
when concept=town.station conv.st=work
does react.complaint
say {sa=give} Come to the kitchen door on Restday. Someone may have something. | {sa=give} We've people for that. But I'll ask. | {sa=give} Can you lift a cask? Come and lift one for me tomorrow, then.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_work_cold
when concept=town.station conv.st=work self.warmth=cold
does react.complaint
say {sa=refuse} We have people for that. | {sa=refuse} Speak to the steward. Not me. | {sa=refuse} I don't hire in the street.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_beg
when concept=town.station conv.st=beg
does react.complaint
say {sa=give} Here. Don't spend it all at once. | {sa=give} Here's a penny. Go and get something hot. | {sa=give} Take this, and don't tell the others.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_beg_cold
when concept=town.station conv.st=beg self.warmth=cold
does react.complaint
say {sa=refuse} Off with you. | {sa=refuse} I don't carry pennies. | {sa=refuse} Find some work.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_beg_warm
when concept=town.station conv.st=beg self.warmth=warm
does react.complaint
say {sa=give} Here. For bread, mind. | {sa=give} Take this. And go round to the Soup Kitchen; tell them I sent you. | {sa=give} I've not much, but have half.
regard other: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_beg_guard
when concept=town.station conv.st=beg self.role=guard
does react.complaint
say {sa=refuse} Move along now. No begging in the street. | {sa=refuse} Go to the chapel; they'll feed you. Go on. | {sa=refuse} I'll not see it, this once. Be gone when I look again.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_beg_sly
when concept=town.station conv.st=beg self.honesty=sly
does react.complaint
say {sa=refuse} Nice try. I've used that one myself. | {sa=refuse} You've a clever tongue. Keep it for someone softer. | {sa=refuse} Ha. Not a penny. But I admire the effort.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_middle
when concept=town.station conv.st=middle
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} And proud of it. | {sa=chat} Better than the Office quarter. They think they're the Heights. | {sa=chat} One good winter. I'm still waiting.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_middle_sump
when concept=town.station conv.st=middle|office self.quarter=sump
does react.complaint
say {sa=jab} Proud of what, exactly? | {sa=jab} We'd swap with you. Today. | {sa=jab} Middle of the hill's still on the hill.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_middle_heights
when concept=town.station conv.st=middle|office self.quarter=heights
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} It's perfectly charming down there. I've driven through. | {sa=chat} We were Commons once. Grandfather never let us forget it. | {sa=chat} It's so... honest, down there.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_office
when concept=town.station conv.st=office
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} Somebody has to count it all. | {sa=chat} Better ink on your paws than blood on them. | {sa=chat} Steady work, though. You'll not starve with a pen.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_heights_poor
when concept=town.station conv.st=heights self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.complaint
say {sa=sneer} Must be dreadful for you. | {sa=sneer} My heart bleeds. Into my one bowl. | {sa=sneer} Terrible troubles you have up there.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_heights_rich
when concept=town.station conv.st=heights self.wealth=rich
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} Dreadful, isn't it. And nobody new to talk about. | {sa=chat} One must suffer for one's standing. | {sa=chat} You must come to ours. We suffer beautifully.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_outside
when concept=town.station conv.st=outside
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} I'd go mad with the quiet. | {sa=chat} Must be nice, a bit of sky. | {sa=chat} Long walk, though, when the rain's on.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_sump
when concept=town.station conv.st=sump
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} That's the Sump for you. | {sa=chat} Gods. It never gets better down there, does it? | {sa=chat} And nobody up the hill bats an eye.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_sump_rich_warm
when concept=town.station conv.st=sump self.wealth=rich self.warmth=warm
does react.complaint
say {sa=kind} That's not right. I'll send something down. Bread. A cask. Something. | {sa=kind} Who sees to it down there? I'll speak to them. | {sa=kind} We've a sack of meal going spare. I'll see it goes down.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_sump_devout
when concept=town.station conv.st=sump self.piety=devout
does react.complaint
say {sa=kind} The chapel's taking bread down on Restday. Come and help. | {sa=kind} The Bright One walks in the Sump as much as anywhere. More, maybe. | {sa=kind} Pray for them. Then carry a sack.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_wharf
when concept=town.station conv.st=wharf|works
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} And the rest goes up the hill. | {sa=chat} That's the city: our paws, their pockets. | {sa=chat} Aye. Same as it ever was.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_wharf_sailor
when concept=town.station conv.st=wharf self.job=sailor|fisher|laborer
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} And the Fish Hall takes the rest. | {sa=chat} I've unloaded a lord's carpet. Smelt better than my bed. | {sa=chat} One day I'll own one crate. Just one. I'll sit on it.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_works_rich
when concept=town.station conv.st=wharf|works self.wealth=rich
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} Well, it's work. Somebody has to be grateful for it. | {sa=bite} The city has to be built by someone. | {sa=bite} Hm. One doesn't think of it, up the hill.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_house
when concept=town.station conv.st=house
does react.complaint
say {sa=houseshrug} The Houses do as they please. Always have. | {sa=houseshrug} I keep out of House business. Healthier. | {sa=houseshrug} Hm. Good for them.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_house_worker
when concept=town.station conv.st=house self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.complaint ask.detail
say {sa=jab} Built with whose paws? | {sa=jab} And the House gives back what? | {sa=jab} Funny how the House always gets the credit and we get the dust.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_houselife
when concept=town.station conv.st=houselife
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} Better than no House at all. | {sa=chat} Steady pay, though. | {sa=chat} I'd take it. Candles counted and all.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_house_member
when concept=town.station conv.st=house_ask self.wealth!=rich
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} I just work there. Same as you would. | {sa=chat} Ask them yourself. I'd like to watch. | {sa=chat} You'd be surprised how little of it comes down to me.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_house_family
when concept=town.station conv.st=house_ask self.wealth=rich
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} One doesn't discuss the House's affairs in the street. | {sa=bite} Write to the steward. | {sa=bite} My father would be delighted to hear your views. In writing.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_poorfriends
when concept=town.station conv.st=poorfriends
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} We'll manage. We always have. | {sa=chat} Ha. One day. Not today, but one day. | {sa=chat} Rich or dead, I'll have you with me.
regard other: affinity +1
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_envy_rich
when concept=town.station conv.st=envy
does react.complaint
say {sa=kind} I've not forgotten. I'll not forget. | {sa=kind} Luck and hard graft, and more luck. You'd have done the same. | {sa=kind} Come to supper and see how little I've changed.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_servant
when concept=town.station conv.st=servant
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} The rich have strange ideas of clean. | {sa=chat} They'll not know your name, but they'll know if the spoon's crooked. | {sa=chat} Did you get the leftovers, at least?
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_servant_rich
when concept=town.station conv.st=servant self.wealth=rich
does react.complaint
say {sa=oblivious} Oh dear. I hope our people aren't so put upon. | {sa=oblivious} Is it so very hard? I've never asked ours. | {sa=oblivious} Hm. I suppose someone polishes ours.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_country
when concept=town.station conv.st=country|city
does react.complaint
say {sa=chat} Every place has its ways. | {sa=chat} Then why'd you come? | {sa=chat} Aye. And every place has its gossips too.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_country_local
when concept=town.station conv.st=country self.from=ridgemere
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} Then go home, if it's so grand. | {sa=bite} You get used to it. Then you get to like it. Then you're one of us. | {sa=bite} A city's not a village. That's the point of it.
then other: town.close

rule n7_sa_city_local
when concept=town.station conv.st=city self.from!=ridgemere
does react.complaint
say {sa=bite} Then go back to your lamps. | {sa=bite} We like it quiet. That's the point. | {sa=bite} Folk here know you because they care. Mostly because they're nosy.
then other: town.close

## The last word on station (the one who made the remark; conv.sa says how it was taken)

rule n7_close_st
when concept=town.close conv.on=station
does ack
say Aye. Well. | Hm. | So it goes.

rule n7_close_st_chat
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=chat
does ack
say Well. That's the world. | Aye. Up the hill and down. | So it goes, top to bottom. | #bc_true_enough#

rule n7_close_st_humble
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=humble
does ack
say Quite. | #bc_good# | #bc_thank_you#

rule n7_close_st_bite
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=bite
does ack
say Hmph. | Touched a nerve, did I? | Suit yourself. | No need to bite.

rule n7_close_st_bite_rich
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=bite self.wealth=rich
does ack
say Well! I never. | How very rude. | One was only making conversation.

rule n7_close_st_bite_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=bite self.temper=short
does ack
say We'll see who's laughing. | Hmph. Fine. #good_day#. | Say that again somewhere quieter.

rule n7_close_st_joke
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=joke
does ack
say Hm. Clever. | Ha. Fair. | I suppose I asked for that.

rule n7_close_st_joke_rich
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=joke self.wealth=rich self.warmth=cold
does ack
say I hardly think that's called for. | Hm. Droll. | Yes. Well. #good_day#.

rule n7_close_st_give
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=give
does ack
say Bless you, #sir#. Bless you. | Thank you. Thank you. | I'll not forget it. | Gods keep you.

rule n7_close_st_refuse
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=refuse
does ack
say Right. Of course. | Gods keep you anyway. | Sorry to have troubled you. | Hmph.

rule n7_close_st_refuse_short
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=refuse self.temper=short
does ack
say Tight-pawed, the lot of you. | I'll remember your face. | Keep it, then. Choke on it.

rule n7_close_st_grateful
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=grateful
does ack
say It's nothing. Truly. | Don't thank me. | Come to the kitchen door if you need more.

rule n7_close_st_proud
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=proud
does ack
say Of course. Forgive me. | The offer stands. | I didn't mean anything by it.

rule n7_close_st_manage
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=manage
does ack
say I admire that. I do. | Hm. Well. I'll think of you. | You're tougher than I am.

rule n7_close_st_advised
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=advised
does ack
say Start small. That's all. | Good. Good. | Mark my words, that's how it's done.

rule n7_close_st_concede
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=concede
does ack
say Hm. Maybe I will. | Well. You're not the worst of them. | Huh. Didn't expect that.

rule n7_close_st_nod
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=nod
does ack
say #good_day#, #sir#. | Thank you, #sir#. | Mind how you go, #sir#.

rule n7_close_st_warmnod
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=warmnod
does ack
say Oh! Well. Thank you. | They're well, thank you for asking. | You're very kind.

rule n7_close_st_sneer
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=sneer
does ack
say All right, all right. | No need to be like that. | Fair. Fair.

rule n7_close_st_sneer_rich
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=sneer self.wealth=rich
does ack
say It is, rather. | Oh, you laugh, but it is. | Hm. I suppose that did sound rather spoilt.

rule n7_close_st_jab
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=jab
does ack
say All right, all right. | No need to be like that. | Fair. Fair. | Hm. Touched a nerve.

rule n7_close_st_oblivious
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=oblivious
does ack
say Ask them, #sir#. You might be surprised. | I'm sure they're very happy, #sir#. | Hm. Somebody does.

rule n7_close_st_houseshrug
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=houseshrug
does ack
say You'll see. The House remembers. | Hm. Folk forget. | Say what you like. It stands.

rule n7_close_st_kind
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=kind
does ack
say That'd be something. | I'll hold you to that. | You're a good sort.

rule n7_close_st_poor
when concept=town.close conv.on=station conv.sa=chat self.wealth=poor|destitute
does ack
say Easy for some. | Aye. And the rain falls on us all. Harder on some. | Well. Back to it.
